			(property "Description" "Audio Jack - 3.5mm TRRS (SMD)\n\nThis is a 3.5mm TRRS SMD audio jack.\nTRRS connectors are the audio-style connectors that you see on some phones, MP3 players and development boards.\nTRRS stands for “tip, ring, ring, sleeve,” which reflects that this  has three conductors and a ground.\n\nSparkFun Products:\n\n• Audio Jack\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/12968 mbed Starter Kit\n• SparkFun TRRS 3.5mm Jack Breakout"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
